      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعْرَةٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A cough:</i> (O, K:) or <i>a sharp cough;</i>
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعِيرَةٌ</span></b> . (IAar, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And (assumed tropical:)  The <i>beginning</i> of an affair or a case; and the <i>newness</i>
thereof: (K, TA:) in some copies of the K,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِدَّتُهُ</span> is erroneously put for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِدَّتُهُ</span>. (TA.)

